comment.body:
Thanks for the report. I reviewed the attached bundle and it shows PowerToys starting and registering several hotkeys, so the missing piece is which specific shortcuts are still failing and whether the new HP keyboard/mouse software is intercepting them. Could you please provide:
1. 2-3 exact PowerToys shortcuts/modules you tested (for example Always On Top, Text Extractor, Shortcut Guide) and what each one did;
2. whether any PowerToys shortcut still works at all;
3. which HP keyboard/mouse utility or driver package is installed, and whether the behavior changes if you fully exit that software or test with the previous keyboard/mouse; and
4. a fresh diagnostic bundle captured immediately after reproducing by commenting /bugreport on the issue and attaching the generated ZIP.
That will tell us whether this is a specific shortcut path or an input-stack conflict.
